# B8 (listing 7151-7207): Mode13 on ControlBallDrained with MultiballCount == 1 ends mode 13: text cleared, mode 2, the
# jail lights reset off (SetJailLights(0)), SetLavaLights(1) clears the lava bank state a_spot11->MessageField, MissionControl.
# Entry with no ball locked is B5. Precondition: the plain new game has one ball in play (multiball == 1). Mode forced to 13 by poke.
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init watch a_spot11.message_field a_spot6.message_field a_kick1.disabled
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
200 poke info_text_box message_field 13
200 poke a_spot11 message_field 5
200 poke a_spot6 message_field 2
200 expect multiball == 1
206 msg a_kick1 FtPartEnable 0
208 expect a_kick1.disabled == 0
210 event drain ControlBallDrained
210 expect mode == 2
210 expect a_kick1.disabled == 1
210 expect a_spot11.message_field == 0
210 expect a_spot6.message_field == 0
210 expect text info_text_box clear
260 quit
